  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE_kpjYvDXVLxWyyXKsy0_VUaDwaTK1Jush7LJtDakIYHc8SshxZSI7GyS-smd1aPXoj2e38aVQgt7ZRYAlGGlIvZxDmSSlIb2oyOurYGDptSLiF-i3Lx2rX08tUOTZBmceniVqai7075Bd8Ni2M5CwT2_3C3n3bhsBVmklVb01jZp83_MpQpQj4B0BDQ/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Apr%208,%202025,%2012_51_11%20PM.png\"><img alt=\"קניבלים הכניסו אדם מערבי לתוך מצנם גדול\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiE_kpjYvDXVLxWyyXKsy0_VUaDwaTK1Jush7LJtDakIYHc8SshxZSI7GyS-smd1aPXoj2e38aVQgt7ZRYAlGGlIvZxDmSSlIb2oyOurYGDptSLiF-i3Lx2rX08tUOTZBmceniVqai7075Bd8Ni2M5CwT2_3C3n3bhsBVmklVb01jZp83_MpQpQj4B0BDQ/w320-h320/ChatGPT%20Image%20Apr%208,%202025,%2012_51_11%20PM.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">הקניבליזם בהלכה</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֹאת הַחַיָּה אֲשֶׁר תֹּאכְלוּ</span></blockquote><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #4c1130; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🕊️ תחילה לשון המקור 📜ואחריה ביאור קצר🔍 להבנה בנחת.</span></span></span></span></span></p><h3 style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 1em 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📜</span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">לשון הרמב\"ם</span></span></span></span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\">הָאָדָם, אַף עַל פִּי שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר בּוֹ \"וַיְהִי הָאָדָם לְנֶפֶשׁ <b>חַיָּה</b>\"&nbsp;- אֵינוֹ מִכְּלַל מִינֵי 'חַיָּה בַּעֲלַת פַּרְסָה' לְפִיכָךְ אֵינוֹ בְּ'לֹא תַּעֲשֶׂה'.</p></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהָאוֹכֵל מִבְּשַׂר הָאָדָם אוֹ מֵחֶלְבּוֹ - בֵּין מִן הַחַי בֵּין מִן הַמֵּת - אֵינוֹ לוֹקֶה.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל, אָסוּר הוּא בַּעֲשֵׂה,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁהֲרֵי, מָנָה הַכָּתוּב שִׁבְעַת מִינֵי חַיָּה, וְאָמַר בָּהֶן \"זֹאת הַחַיָּה אֲשֶׁר תֹּאכְלוּ\",<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָא, כָּל שֶׁהוּא חוּץ מֵהֶן - לֹא תֹּאכְלוּ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְלָאו הַבָּא מִכְּלַל עֲשֵׂה - עֲשֵׂה.</span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">◼️</span></span></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #626262; font-family: Cairo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><h3 style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 1em 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🔍 ביאור בעברית מדוברת</span></span></span></span></h3></div><div><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><p data-end=\"274\" data-start=\"115\">הרמב\"ם מבאר, כי אף שנאמר על האדם <em data-end=\"154\" data-start=\"132\">“ויהי האדם לנפש חיה”</em>, אין הוא נכלל בגדר בעלי-החיים המותרים באכילה. הוא איננו בכלל “חיה בעלת פרסה”, ולכן אכילתו איננה אסורה באיסור <em data-end=\"273\" data-start=\"264\">לא תעשה</em>.</p>\n<p data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"276\">משום כך, מי שאוכל מבשר אדם או משומנו — בין אם מן החי ובין אם מן המת — אינו לוקה.</p>\n<p data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"358\">עם זאת, אכילת בשר אדם אסורה באיסור <em data-end=\"398\" data-start=\"393\">עשה</em>. זאת משום שהתורה מונה רשימה סגורה של שבעה מיני חיות ואומרת עליהן: <em data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"465\">“זאת החיה אשר תאכלו”</em>. מכאן משתמע שכל מה שאינו כלול ברשימה זו — אין לאכול אותו. והאדם, אף שהוא נקרא “נפש חיה”, אינו נמנה עם אותן שבע חיות.</p>\n<p data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"606\">ולפיכך, איסור שנלמד מכלל מצוות עשה — דינו כמצוות עשה.</p></span></span></span></span></div>"
}
